# Headset session 9, launch 1 of 3 (lane M, frame/perf/session-h9/README.md): the default (sets two
# refreshes ahead, the runtime's own eye poses), with one XRE line per locate: do the eye-to-head offsets
# SteamVR gives us move from refresh to refresh during head turns, and more in the right eye?
# Standstill head turns first (countdown or braked), then driving with head turns, then hold still.
KARTFRAME_EYE_OFFSETS=located
KARTFRAME_FRAME_LOG=1
KARTFRAME_RECORD=raw
KARTFRAME_SESSION_ENV_ONCE=1
